@strong{Structural parameters} (Speaker Config, Decor Mode, Velvet Duration, Velvet Density, Low Latency, Freq Resolution, Bypass Decor, Binaural Preview) require rebuilding the plugin when changed. Other parameters update in real-time with zero dropout.

@node upmixer Plugin Developer Guide
@section Developer Guide

SOTF Upmixer plugin for stereo to surround upmixing.

Converts stereo audio to surround formats (5.1 through 9.1.6) using FFT-based Direct/Ambient decomposition combined with VBAP panning for spatial placement.

@subsubheading Parameter wiring

All parameters reach the audio thread through the host's @code{rebuild_cached_parameters} / @code{set_parameter} / @code{get_parameter} triad. Structural parameters (marked in the notes below) trigger a rebuild; the rest update in real time with zero dropouts.

